WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:04.504
I think we all dream about
having those dates where it
feels like a movie.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.714
Cole:
That was quite a date.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:08.592
Things go well, but then he
screws everything up.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.345
I sent Sadie one text today.
One.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:14.014
And some light emoji stuff, but
that doesn't count.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:16.600
Things just go downhill from
then on.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:20.270
You have the wrong guy!

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:23.607
Who are you?

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:24.399
CIA.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.360
Were you really gonna call me
when you got back?

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:31.031
Yes, until you texted me eleven
times in two days.

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.324
Emoji stuff doesn't count.

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.867
Emoji stuff counts.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.453
Chris and Ana are so brilliant
at creating that connection.

00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:40.832
I cannot believe you got me
kidnapped and tortured all after
one date!

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:47.965
Ana de Armas:
I was really looking forward to
working with Chris again,

00:00:47.965 --> 00:00:50.092
Ana de Armas:
but in completely different
roles.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.095
You're a liar. It's just lies and
lies and more lies.

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:57.516
It's not lies and more lies.
It's the sub-lie of the first
original lie.

00:00:57.516 --> 00:00:58.558
You're unbelievable.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:02.896
Ana is so effortlessly cool and
composed.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.940
Chris Evans:
I've yet to see something she
can't do.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:05.816
Are you ready?

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:08.944
Adrien Brody:
The scale of this is enormous.

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:11.488
Adrien Brody:
So many moving pieces.

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:12.364
It's exciting.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.449
Leveque:
If anything should go wrong...

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:17.327
Leveque:
Everyone dies.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.162
The stakes are incredibly high.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.916
It's just chemical weapons, and
bullets, and death.

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:26.712
But it's still rooted in
something authentic.

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:29.172
In my line of work it's better
being alone.

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:29.673
Cole:
Is it?

00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:32.259
It's very charming, it has a big
heart.

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:34.511
Protecting the people you love
is never a mistake.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.100
It's a story of taking a risk
outside of your comfort zone.

00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:43.937
Chris Evans:
And how rewarding and refreshing
it can feel to wake up-

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:46.273
-and maybe not recognize
yourself.

00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:48.900
Who the hell are you?

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:50.527
I'm the boyfriend.

